{"id":"000W3J","title":"The Next To Lie","author":"The Pi Guy","solvedCount":3,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-17T22:57:06+00:00","posted":"Heute, 20:00 Uhr","rules":"My 2nd liar cells puzzle. Hope you like it. :)\n\nSudoku: Put the digits 1 to 9 once each into every row, column & 3 by 3 box.\n\nLiar Cells: Every row, column & 3 by 3 box contains one liar cell, whose real value is different from its digit.\n\n• Each liar cell contains a different digit from 1 to 9.\n\n• Each liar cell has a different value from 1 to 9.\n\nConsecutive Sum Lines: The box borders divide each cyan line into sections. The sum of the values on all neighbouring line sections must be consecutive (e.g. if row 6 col 6 has a value of 5, row 6 col 7-8 must add to a value of either 4 or 6). Values & sums may repeat.\n\n[The section to the right of the grid is just for keeping track of liar digits & values and is not part of the solution check.]\n\nPuzzle link (SudokuPad)","solutionCode":"The values in column 5 (top to bottom).","tags":["Sudoku","Modifier Cells (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/l6khwvriye","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/l6khwvriye","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":12,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-17T22:57:06+00:00"}